        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>世界气候类型的分布</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n        color: #222;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n        background-color: #fff;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 20px;\n    }\n    .page {\n        max-width: 800px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        padding: 40px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    h1 {\n        font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n        font-size: 1.4em;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        margin-top: 0;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    p {\n        margin: 0 0 15px 0;\n        text-align: justify;\n    }\n    .indent {\n        text-indent: 2em;\n    }\n    .highlight {\n        background-color: #ffebd6;\n        padding: 0 2px;\n        border-radius: 2px;\n    }\n    .grid {\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n        column-gap: 30px;\n        row-gap: 20px;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .grid-item {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n        background-color: #f5f5f5;\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        color: #888;\n        font-family: sans-serif;\n        font-size: 0.9em;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n        width: 100%;\n    }\n    .img-tl { aspect-ratio: 1 / 1.1; }\n    .img-tr { aspect-ratio: 1.4 / 1; }\n    .img-bl { aspect-ratio: 1 / 1.1; }\n    .img-br { aspect-ratio: 1.4 / 1; }\n    \n    .caption {\n        font-size: 0.85em;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        margin: 0;\n    }\n    .icon-arrow {\n        display: inline-flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        width: 1.2em;\n        height: 1.2em;\n        background-color: #3cb371;\n        color: white;\n        border-radius: 50%;\n        font-size: 0.8em;\n        margin-right: 4px;\n        vertical-align: middle;\n        position: relative;\n        top: -1px;\n    }\n    .figure-title {\n        font-size: 0.85em;\n        color: #333;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n    .conclusion {\n        margin-left: 38%;\n        text-indent: 2em;\n        margin-bottom: 40px;\n    }\n    .footer {\n        font-size: 0.9em;\n        color: #333;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n    }\n    .footer .page-num {\n        margin-right: 15px;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n    <h1>世界气候类型的分布</h1>\n    \n    <p class=\"indent\">\n        虽然世界的气候复杂多样（图3.27），但是它们的分布有一定规律。例如，<span class=\"highlight\">由赤道地区到极地地区，有规律地分布着热带的、亚热带的、温带的和寒带的气候。</span>不同的气候类型呈现出不同的自然景观。\n    </p>\n    \n    <div class=\"grid\">\n        <div class=\"grid-item\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder img-tl\">[Photo: Tropical Rainforest]</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">\n                <span class=\"icon-arrow\">↑</span> <span class=\"highlight\">热带雨林气候主要分布在赤道附近地区。</span>这里全年高温多雨，植物终年常绿，许多地方分布着茂密的热带雨林。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid-item\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder img-tr\">[Photo: Tropical Savanna]</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">\n                <span class=\"icon-arrow\">↑</span> <span class=\"highlight\">热带草原气候主要分布在热带雨林气候的南北两侧。这里终年高温，一年中有明显的干季和雨季。</span>地面上树木稀疏，长着较高的草。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid-item\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder img-bl\">[Photo: Temperate Deciduous Forest]</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">\n                <span class=\"icon-arrow\">↑</span> <span class=\"highlight\">温带季风气候主要分布在温带地区的亚欧大陆东部。这里四季分明，夏季高温多雨，冬季寒冷干燥。</span>生长着落叶阔叶林。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid-item\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder img-br\">[Photo: Polar Climate]</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">\n                <span class=\"icon-arrow\">↑</span> <span class=\"highlight\">寒带气候主要分布在极圈以内，大部分地区气温很低，地面被冰雪覆盖。</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"figure-title\">图3.27 不同气候类型的自然景观</div>\n    \n    <p class=\"conclusion\">\n        其中，热带的气候大致分布在南、北回归线之间，寒带的气候大致分布在南、北极圈内，亚热带和温带的气候大致分布在北回归线与北极圈、南回归线与南极圈之间。在中纬度地区，由大陆东岸、大陆西岸向大陆内部，气候类型的分布也是有规律的。\n    </p>\n    \n    <div class=\"footer\">\n        <span class=\"page-num\">64</span> <span>第三章 天气与气候</span>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
